    "sentence_translations": [
      "You and Me",
      "",
      "Little Yue noticed Yixue’s watch, but did I hear it wrong? She said it was her watch?",
      "",
      "I asked Little Yue, “Is that your watch?”",
      "",
      "“It’s mine,” she said, “This watch disappeared during a college trip.",
      "I searched for a long time without finding it. Where did you find it?”",
      "",
      "I still thought I had heard it wrong and asked, “Did you open the back of the watch?”",
      "",
      "Little Yue said, “No, what’s the matter?”",
      "",
      "“Do you know what’s in the back of the watch?”",
      "",
      "Little Yue smiled, a little embarrassed, and said, “I know, there is a picture of you there.”",
      "",
      "I asked, “Are there any letters on the back of the photo?”",
      "",
      "“Yes, B and G,” Little Yue said.",
      "",
      "“What does that mean?”",
      "",
      "“B and G are names. B is your surname, Bai, BAI. G is my surname, Guan, GUAN. B and G are you and me.”"
    ]
  }
